{"task_id": "Mbpp/14", "solution": "def find_Volume(param1, param2, param3):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the volume of a triangular prism given its base, height, and length.\n    \"\"\"\n    # The formula for the volume of a triangular prism is (1/2) * base * height * length.\n    # We assume param1 is base, param2 is height, and param3 is length.\n    volume = 0.5 * param1 * param2 * param3\n    return volume"}
