{"task_id": "Mbpp/61", "solution": "def count_Substrings(s: str) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Count substrings where digit sum equals length.\"\"\"\n\n    def calculate_digit_sum_nested(s_digits: str) -> int:\n        \"\"\"Calculate sum of all digits in a string.\"\"\"\n        total_sum = 0\n        for char_digit in s_digits:\n            total_sum += int(char_digit)\n        return total_sum\n\n    def is_valid_substring_nested(substring: str) -> bool:\n        \"\"\"Check if substring digit sum equals its length.\"\"\"\n        return calculate_digit_sum_nested(substring) == len(substring)\n\n    def generate_all_substrings_nested(main_s: str) -> list[str]:\n        \"\"\"Generate all contiguous substrings.\"\"\"\n        substrings = []\n        n = len(main_s)\n        for i in range(n):\n            for j in range(i, n):\n                substrings.append(main_s[i : j + 1])\n        return substrings\n\n    count = 0\n    all_substrings = generate_all_substrings_nested(s)\n\n    for sub in all_substrings:\n        if is_valid_substring_nested(sub):\n            count += 1\n\n    return count"}
