{"task_id": "Mbpp/84", "solution": "def sequence(n):\n    \"\"\"Calculates the nth number in the Newman-Conway sequence.\n    Uses memoization for efficient computation of recursive calls.\n    \"\"\"\n    memo = {} # Initialize memoization cache\n\n    def _calculate_newman_conway(k, cache):\n        \"\"\"Helper function to recursively compute Newman-Conway sequence numbers with memoization.\"\"\"\n        if k == 1 or k == 2:\n            return 1 # Base cases P(1)=1, P(2)=1\n        \n        if k in cache:\n            return cache[k] # Return cached value if available\n\n        # Compute P(k) = P(P(k-1)) + P(k-P(k-1))\n        val_k_minus_1 = _calculate_newman_conway(k - 1, cache)\n        result = _calculate_newman_conway(val_k_minus_1, cache) + _calculate_newman_conway(k - val_k_minus_1, cache)\n        \n        cache[k] = result # Store computed value in cache\n        return result\n\n    # Assume n will always be a valid positive integer (>= 1) based on constraints.\n    return _calculate_newman_conway(n, memo)"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/84", "solution": "def sequence(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the nth number in the Newman-Conway sequence using memoization.\n    The sequence is defined by P(1)=1, P(2)=1, and P(n) = P(P(n-1)) + P(n-P(n-1)) for n > 2.\n    \"\"\"\n    memo = {} # Cache for storing already computed sequence values.\n\n    def _calculate(k: int) -> int:\n        \"\"\"\n        Helper function to compute the kth Newman-Conway number recursively with memoization.\n        \"\"\"\n        if k in memo:\n            return memo[k]\n\n        if k == 1 or k == 2:\n            result = 1\n        else:\n            # P(n) = P(P(n-1)) + P(n-P(n-1))\n            val_n_minus_1 = _calculate(k - 1)\n            term1 = _calculate(val_n_minus_1)\n            term2 = _calculate(k - val_n_minus_1)\n            result = term1 + term2\n\n        memo[k] = result\n        return result\n\n    return _calculate(n)"}
