{"task_id": "Mbpp/126", "solution": "def find_divisors(num: int) -> list:\n    \"\"\"Finds all positive divisors of a given number.\"\"\"\n    divisors = []\n    for i in range(1, num + 1):\n        if num % i == 0:\n            divisors.append(i)\n    return divisors\n\ndef find_common_divisors(divisors1: list, divisors2: list) -> list:\n    \"\"\"Identifies common divisors from two lists of divisors.\"\"\"\n    set1 = set(divisors1)\n    set2 = set(divisors2)\n    common = list(set1.intersection(set2))\n    return common\n\ndef calculate_sum(numbers: list) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the arithmetic sum of a list of integers.\"\"\"\n    total = 0\n    for number in numbers:\n        total += number\n    return total\n\ndef sum(num1: int, num2: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the sum of common divisors of two numbers.\"\"\"\n    divisors1 = find_divisors(num1)\n    divisors2 = find_divisors(num2)\n    common_divs = find_common_divisors(divisors1, divisors2)\n    result = calculate_sum(common_divs)\n    return result"}
