{"task_id": "Mbpp/137", "solution": "def zero_count(array: list[int]) -> float:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the ratio of zero values to non-zero values in a list of integers.\n    Handles the case of no non-zero elements by returning 0.0 to prevent division by zero.\n    \"\"\"\n    num_zeros = 0\n    num_non_zeros = 0\n\n    for x in array:\n        if x == 0:\n            num_zeros += 1\n        else:\n            num_non_zeros += 1\n\n    if num_non_zeros == 0:\n        return 0.0\n    else:\n        return num_zeros / num_non_zeros"}
