{"task_id": "Mbpp/138", "solution": "def _validate_positive_integer(number: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Validates if the input number is a positive integer.\"\"\"\n    return number > 0\n\ndef _check_binary_representation(number: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Checks if the number's binary representation excludes the 2^0 term.\"\"\"\n    return (number % 2 == 0)\n\ndef is_Sum_Of_Powers_Of_Two(number: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if the given number can be represented as a sum of distinct non-zero powers of 2.\n    This is true if and only if the number is a positive even integer.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not _validate_positive_integer(number):\n        return False\n    \n    return _check_binary_representation(number)"}
