{"task_id": "Mbpp/223", "solution": "def is_majority(array, n, element):\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if an element is the majority element in a sorted array.\n    A majority element occurs more than n/2 times.\n    \"\"\"\n\n    def _binary_search_first(arr, target, length):\n        \"\"\"Finds the index of the first occurrence of the target element.\"\"\"\n        low = 0\n        high = length - 1\n        result = -1\n        while low <= high:\n            mid = low + (high - low) // 2\n            if arr[mid] == target:\n                result = mid\n                high = mid - 1\n            elif arr[mid] < target:\n                low = mid + 1\n            else:\n                high = mid - 1\n        return result\n\n    def _binary_search_last(arr, target, length):\n        \"\"\"Finds the index of the last occurrence of the target element.\"\"\"\n        low = 0\n        high = length - 1\n        result = -1\n        while low <= high:\n            mid = low + (high - low) // 2\n            if arr[mid] == target:\n                result = mid\n                low = mid + 1\n            elif arr[mid] < target:\n                low = mid + 1\n            else:\n                high = mid - 1\n        return result\n\n    if n == 0:\n        return False\n\n    first_index = _binary_search_first(array, element, n)\n\n    if first_index == -1:\n        return False\n\n    last_index = _binary_search_last(array, element, n)\n\n    count = last_index - first_index + 1\n    \n    return count > (n // 2)"}
