{"task_id": "Mbpp/237", "solution": "def check_occurences(tuple_list: list) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"\n    Counts occurrences of unique normalized tuples in a list.\n    Normalizes tuples by sorting their elements before counting.\n    \"\"\"\n\n    def normalize_tuple(input_tuple: tuple) -> tuple:\n        \"\"\"Sorts the integer elements within a tuple to create a normalized representation.\"\"\"\n        return tuple(sorted(list(input_tuple)))\n\n    def count_occurrences(normalized_tuples: list) -> dict:\n        \"\"\"Counts the frequency of each normalized tuple in a list.\"\"\"\n        counts = {}\n        for tpl in normalized_tuples:\n            counts[tpl] = counts.get(tpl, 0) + 1\n        return counts\n\n    normalized_list = [normalize_tuple(tpl) for tpl in tuple_list]\n    return count_occurrences(normalized_list)"}
