{"task_id": "Mbpp/265", "solution": "def list_split(input_list, n):\n    \"\"\"\n    Splits a list into n sublists, distributing elements cyclically based on their original index.\n    Each sublist contains elements starting from a different offset.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n <= 0:\n        return []\n\n    # Initialize n empty sublists\n    sublists = [[] for _ in range(n)]\n\n    # Distribute elements cyclically\n    for i, element in enumerate(input_list):\n        sublist_index = i % n\n        sublists[sublist_index].append(element)\n\n    return sublists"}
