{"task_id": "Mbpp/270", "solution": "def sum_even_and_even_index(input_list: list) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of even numbers located at even positions within a list.\n    Positions are zero-based indexed.\n    \"\"\"\n    def is_even_position(index: int) -> bool:\n        \"\"\"Checks if a given index is an even position.\"\"\"\n        return index % 2 == 0\n\n    def is_even_number(value: int) -> bool:\n        \"\"\"Checks if a given number is even.\"\"\"\n        return value % 2 == 0\n\n    total_sum = 0\n    for index, value in enumerate(input_list):\n        if is_even_position(index) and is_even_number(value):\n            total_sum += value\n    return total_sum"}
