{"task_id": "Mbpp/274", "solution": "def _factorial(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the factorial of a non-negative integer.\"\"\"\n    res = 1\n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        res *= i\n    return res\n\ndef _calculate_binomial_coefficient(n: int, k: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates C(n,k) = n! / (k! * (n-k)!).\"\"\"\n    return _factorial(n) // (_factorial(k) * _factorial(n - k))\n\ndef _validate_input(n: any) -> None:\n    \"\"\"Validates input n is a positive integer.\"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(n, int):\n        raise TypeError(\"Input 'n' must be an integer.\")\n    if n <= 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"Input 'n' must be a positive integer.\")\n\ndef even_binomial_Coeff_Sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of even index binomial coefficients for a positive integer n.\n    Raises TypeError if n is not an integer, ValueError if n is not positive.\n    \"\"\"\n    _validate_input(n)\n\n    total_sum = 0\n    for k in range(0, n + 1, 2):\n        total_sum += _calculate_binomial_coefficient(n, k)\n    \n    return total_sum"}
