{"task_id": "Mbpp/286", "solution": "def max_sub_array_sum_repeated(array: list[int], k: int, expected: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the largest sum of a contiguous array in the modified array\n    formed by repeating the given array k times.\n    \"\"\"\n\n    def kadane_algorithm(arr: list[int]) -> int:\n        \"\"\"\n        Calculates the maximum subarray sum using Kadane's algorithm.\n        Returns 0 if the array is empty.\n        \"\"\"\n        if not arr:\n            return 0\n\n        current_max = arr[0]\n        global_max = arr[0]\n\n        for x in arr[1:]:\n            current_max = max(x, current_max + x)\n            global_max = max(global_max, current_max)\n        return global_max\n\n    if not array or k == 0:\n        return 0\n\n    if k == 1:\n        return kadane_algorithm(array)\n\n    total_array_sum = sum(array)\n\n    # Calculate max sum for two repetitions, covering cases where the max subarray\n    # is entirely within one repetition or spans one boundary.\n    max_sum_two_reps = kadane_algorithm(array + array)\n\n    if total_array_sum > 0:\n        # If the total sum of the array is positive, including full blocks\n        # might increase the overall sum.\n        max_prefix_sum = 0\n        current_prefix_sum = 0\n        for x in array:\n            current_prefix_sum += x\n            max_prefix_sum = max(max_prefix_sum, current_prefix_sum)\n\n        max_suffix_sum = 0\n        current_suffix_sum = 0\n        for x in reversed(array):\n            current_suffix_sum += x\n            max_suffix_sum = max(max_suffix_sum, current_suffix_sum)\n\n        # Consider the sum from a max prefix, (k-2) full positive array sums, and a max suffix.\n        max_sum_with_full_blocks = max_prefix_sum + (k - 2) * total_array_sum + max_suffix_sum\n        \n        return max(max_sum_two_reps, max_sum_with_full_blocks)\n    else:\n        # If the total sum is non-positive, adding full repetitions will not increase the sum.\n        # The maximum sum must be within at most two concatenated repetitions.\n        return max_sum_two_reps"}
